        "id": "IN2",
        "study_id": "S1",
        "part_id": null,
        "statement": "The results support expanding the cTTO component of the EQ-5D-Y valuation design beyond ten states, because the larger set of states made the non-linearity visible and allowed the mapping function to be identified.",
