        "id": "IN3",
        "study_id": "S1",
        "part_id": null,
        "statement": "Choosing a non-linear transformation violates the interval-scale assumption for combined cTTO/DCE values, but was preferred because linear mapping either produced values above 1 for mild states or mispredicted severe states by about 0.4; the ordering of states was preserved.",
