        "id": "LI1",
        "study_id": "S1",
        "part_id": null,
        "statement": "Even the expanded 23-state cTTO design was too small: few cTTO values were collected where the value curve bends most, and the design could not support model specifications other than main effects, so the decision between mapping functions rested largely on two outlying observations.",
